{
  "longTitle": "To make provision in connection with the making of loans to Ireland by the United Kingdom.",
  "summary": "<p>The Bill authorises the Treasury to loan up to &pound;3.25bn to Ireland, and contains an order-making power to increase this limit subject to affirmative procedure in the Commons. </p><p>It also arranges for six-monthly reporting to Parliament on the status of the loan. </p>",
